\contentsline {table}{\numberline {5.1}{\ignorespaces Brain-TokenGT (stabilised) held-out test AUC across 19 completed runs of the identical configuration. Seed 42 alone spans an AUC range of $0.35$ --- from well below chance to the best result obtained at any seed.}}{34}{table.5.1}%
\contentsline {table}{\numberline {5.2}{\ignorespaces Parameter and representation asymmetry. The sign of the CV-to-test gap is the interpretable quantity: Brain-TokenGT's high validation performance does not transfer, which is the classic small-sample overfitting signature.}}{36}{table.5.2}%
